{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 2, "text": "带领孝子贤孙去魂归径中将亡魂引出，引魂时观众也参加，因为过刀山、火海、血河被人", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 270, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "带领孝子贤孙去魂归径中将亡魂引出，引魂时观众也参加，因为过刀山、火海、血河被人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 270, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 3, "text": "们视为可免掉人生几多灾难的活动。“血河”上搭有一块木板，布摩先带魂主子孙从上", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 324, "w": 1544, "h": 70}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "们视为可免掉人生几多灾难的活动。“血河”上搭有一块木板，布摩先带魂主子孙从上", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 324, "w": 1544, "h": 70}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 4, "text": "“渡”过，以示魂主开始离开苦海；“火海”旁备有一堆荞麦糠壳，由一布摩徒弟在旁念经，", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 398, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“渡”过，以示魂主开始离开苦海；“火海”旁备有一堆荞麦糠壳，由一布摩徒弟在旁念经，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 398, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 5, "text": "向油锅中撒一把糠壳便有一人从火焰中跃过，以使亡魂走向光明；过刀山时布摩在旁用", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 467, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "向油锅中撒一把糠壳便有一人从火焰中跃过，以使亡魂走向光明；过刀山时布摩在旁用", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 467, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 6, "text": "功念咒，孝子们纷纷赤脚从利刃上走过，众", "bbox_px": {"x": 828, "y": 531, "w": 780, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "功念咒，孝子们纷纷赤脚从利刃上走过，众", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 828, "y": 531, "w": 780, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 7, "text": "人皆从旁绕道。招魂活动整整一目才结束，", "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 599, "w": 764, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人皆从旁绕道。招魂活动整整一目才结束，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 599, "w": 764, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 8, "text": "最后将做魂归径的芦苇拔下烧掉，将写有魂", "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 660, "w": 764, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "最后将做魂归径的芦苇拔下烧掉，将写有魂", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 660, "w": 764, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 9, "text": "主名字的牌位护送至主家，安放于神龛上，", "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 728, "w": 764, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "主名字的牌位护送至主家，安放于神龛上，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 728, "w": 764, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 10, "text": "等待来日“古谢”（即殡亡）。①在一些地方，", "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 789, "w": 764, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "等待来日“古谢”（即殡亡）。①在一些地方，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 789, "w": 764, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 11, "text": "著名长篇史诗《安王与祖王》就是在这个仪", "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 853, "w": 764, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "著名长篇史诗《安王与祖王》就是在这个仪", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 853, "w": 764, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 12, "text": "式上吟诵的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 917, "w": 233, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "式上吟诵的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 917, "w": 233, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
