{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 15, "text": "占卜又称算卦，是一种根据某种征象来", "bbox_px": {"x": 933, "y": 1110, "w": 683, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "占卜又称算卦，是一种根据某种征象来", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 933, "y": 1110, "w": 683, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 16, "text": "预测吉凶祸福的神秘“技术”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 1170, "w": 528, "h": 70}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "预测吉凶祸福的神秘“技术”。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 848, "y": 1170, "w": 528, "h": 70}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 156, "line_no": 17, "text": "布依族的占卜习俗由来已久，方式也很", "bbox_px": {"x": 933, "y": 1239, "w": 683, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族的占卜习俗由来已久，方式也很", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 933, "y": 1239, "w": 683, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
